# Build context for the Cautela frontend image (ma_gatekeeper/frontend/Dockerfile)
# is the MONOREPO ROOT, because the frontend's tailwind.config.ts imports
# `../../design/tokens` (= <root>/design/tokens.ts), a sibling of ma_gatekeeper/.
# The repo is multi-GB (datasets, .venv, python), so this file uses an
# allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only the two subtrees the image
# needs — ma_gatekeeper/frontend/ (sans node_modules/.next) and design/.

# 1) Ignore the entire context by default.
*

# 2) Re-include the frontend app.
!ma_gatekeeper
ma_gatekeeper/*
!ma_gatekeeper/frontend
ma_gatekeeper/frontend/node_modules
ma_gatekeeper/frontend/.next
ma_gatekeeper/frontend/.env
ma_gatekeeper/frontend/.env.*
!ma_gatekeeper/frontend/.env.example

# 3) Re-include the design token source the frontend imports at build time.
#    (design/ is large — 16MB of assets — but tailwind only needs tokens.ts.
#    We re-include the whole dir for simplicity; trim here if context size bites.)
!design

# 4) Never ship VCS / secrets / OS cruft even if re-included above.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
